              "datePublished": "2026-10-18",
              "reviewBody": "Made this last night and the whole family love them. I actually prefer them to my usual baked chipotle chicken crispy tacos, and they were much quicker. We added sliced avocado to the tacos and then the sauce, served it with corn/black bean salad.",
