                "name": "Katherine"
              },
              "datePublished": "2026-10-17",
              "reviewBody": "These are a weekly dinner for us. I've probably cooked them more than any recipe! My 5yo loves them (I cut the chipotle down to 1T) and they're so fast to throw together after work, yet feel decadent and delicious.",
              "reviewRating": {
